title: "latent-decision-models"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible Python tools for trial-level modeling of decision confidence and belief
  updating from behavior, EEG and fMRI, with audited OpenNeuro datasets and
  subject-disjoint evaluation. Research software in active development.
